<title>UK: BOE allots 120 mln stg in outright bills.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 120 mln stg in outright bills.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it allotted 120 million stg in outright bills to April 7, bringing total liquidity provided to the market to 1.9 billion stg.</p>
</text>
